{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國財政部國際事務次長Erin Browne上周來港參加亞太經合組織（APEC）財政部長會議。</p><p>事隔近一周後，Browne透露在港期間曾會見多間美資大行高層，以及分別與越南、新西蘭、新加坡及澳洲財政部代表會面。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T02:38:15.565384+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T02:13:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T13:38:27.345097+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T02:38:15.565384+00:00","content_hash":"e8bd83f89177384ae8b53cc9b54bd618102189bac951ac1a3540abedcccf488e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T02:38:15.565384+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-blocked","latest_error":"HTTP 403"},"content_capture":null}